{"id":526812776,"iid":4,"project_id":55437356,"title":"ci: primary pipeline validates the factory; retire Jira watcher and dummy build","description":"The root pipeline now tests the factory itself (four suites in dind, gating image builds) instead of building a FROM-scratch dummy. Jira watcher removed — no longer used. Task templates under tasks/ are unchanged for consumers.\n\n## Also in this MR: referenceable tags\n\nPublished tags change from `\u003ctoolversion\u003e-\u003cYYYYMMDD\u003e` to **`\u003ctoolversion\u003e-r\u003cN\u003e`** — `godot:4.7.2-stable-r3` instead of `godot:4.7.2-stable-20260901`. `N` is a per-image release counter, monotonic across versions (higher `r` is always the newer build), derived from the committed records; the build date lives inside the record. Bump MRs read `r3 → r4`.\n\nOne-time migration of the three day-one records to their `r1` names. The published images were retagged **zero-copy** in the registry (same digests, verified); the dated tags remain as immutable twins. Consumer pins in `tasks/` moved to `r1`; aura-brawlers !103 is pinned to `godot:4.7.2-stable-r1`.\n\n## Verified in CI\n\nEight iterations of dind wiring, all now encoded in the harness: no git identity on runners, scratch dirs must live under `/builds` for bind mounts, **SaaS services cannot resolve each other** (the test registry runs on the dind daemon, addressed by its IPv4), and registry tag listings can lag a push briefly.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01Bdxmhvqc422NfDRV4HgJns","state":"merged","created_at":"2026-09-01T23:36:09.687Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T16:34:24.189Z","merged_by":{"id":9820378,"username":"DomPolizzi","public_email":"","name":"Dominic","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/9820378/avatar.png?v=1788482984","web_url":"https://gitlab.com/DomPolizzi"},"merge_user":{"id":9820378,"username":"DomPolizzi","public_email":"